important parts of scenes

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:25.680
were actually cropped out of the frame.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:27.560
With that, Snyder was sure to be clear

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:29.440
that he most definitely won't be using

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.090
